{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21820","headline":"紫踯躅 · 元稹","name":"紫踯躅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫踯躅，灭紫拢帬倚山腹。\n文君新寡乍归来，羞怨春风不能哭。\n我从相识便相怜，但是花丛不回目。\n去年春别湘水头，今年夏见青山曲。\n迢迢远在青山上，山高水阔难容足。\n愿爲朝日早相暾，愿作轻风暗相触。\n尔踯躅，我向通州尔幽独。\n可怜今夜宿青山，何年却向青山宿。\n山花渐暗月渐明，月照空山满山绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}